# Root .gitignore for ExilePact2

# Game binaries and proprietary assets -- never committed (AGENTS.md § "Legal")
*.exe
*.dll
*.ggpk
*.bundle.bin
**/Bundles2/
*.dds
*.ogg
*.wav
*.bank
**/data/raw/
**/raw/
**/extracted/

# Decompiler / disassembler artifacts -- never committed, see "Legal: Decompiled
# Output Never Reaches Any Origin" in AGENTS.md. Full function dumps stay on the
# researcher's machine only.
*.i64
*.idb0
*.idb1
*.til
*.gpr
*.rep/
*.bndb
**/ghidra_projects/
**/decompiled/
**/disassembly/
*.dis
# tools/decomp_index.py's index of local decompiles (docs/tools/decomp-index.md)
decomp-index*.jsonl

# Python build, bytecode & environments
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# C++ build artifacts
*.obj
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.idb
bin/
out/
x64/
x86/

# Node / TypeScript
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# IDE & OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude Code: the shared configuration in .claude/ is committed on purpose --
# hooks, agents and skills are project rules, not personal taste. Only the
# per-machine override file is local.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Worktrees created under .claude/; `git add -A` would embed each one as a
# nested repository.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scratch*/
.claude/scratch-*

# Planning documents: a plan is out of date the moment the thing is built.
# Keep the plan on your own machine (AGENTS.md § "Documentation").
*-plan.md

# Workorder context files, round snapshots, raw session logs, per-workorder
# output directories and JSON: working notes and evidence for the run, not
# documentation of the change.
.claude/workorders/*-context.md
.claude/workorders/.rounds/
.claude/workorders/*.log
.claude/workorders/*/
.claude/workorders/*.json
# live-operator's session captures, folded into docs by the record round.
.claude/workorders/*-live-*.md

# Playwright MCP snapshots and screenshots (per-session output)
.playwright-mcp/
